ARCHETYPE 03: Michael Jordan -- Malignant System Archetype
----------------------------------------------------------
Biological Label: Cancer System
Basketball Phenotype: Ultra-competitive scoring + two-way dominance that begins as
  an undetected prospect and eventually reorganizes the entire league organism around itself.

Narrative Arc:
  Undetected Lesion -- Jordan emerges as a scoring anomaly on a non-contender.
  Local Tumor       -- Championship Bulls dominate; entire East must adapt or die.
  Metastasis        -- Post-Jordan era filled with Jordan-derivative wings, branding,
    and mental models of the alpha scorer. The league is permanently altered.

Metric Suite (extends existing Cancer Treatment metrics: TER, Four Factors, DRtg, Gravity):
  Clonal Expansion Curve (CEC)
    Definition: Jordan's growth from low-minute prospect to dominant force.
    Formula: Usage rate, efficiency, and team success over time plotted as tumor-growth curve.

  Host Takeover Index (HTI)
    Definition: Degree to which Jordan's presence reorganizes the NBA organism.
    Formula: Championship share over prime years + rules/stylistic shifts attributable
    to him + market share in ratings, merchandise, and cultural references.

  Metastatic Spread Score (MSS)
    Definition: How far his pattern spreads beyond the original tumor site (Bulls).
    Formula: Number of Jordan-style wings and systems (isolation mid-post scorers,
    fadeaway-heavy offenses) + global expansion linked to his brand.

