ARCHETYPE 04: Nikola Jokic -- Central Nervous System / Endocrine Hub
---------------------------------------------------------------------
Biological Label: Hypothalamic-Pituitary Axis / CNS Controller
Basketball Phenotype: High-usage hub at elbow and top of arc balancing scoring,
  passing, and pace control -- regulating downstream teammates via signaling.

Narrative Arc:
  The CNS archetype does not attack directly. It controls the rate, timing, and
  distribution of resources across the organism. Remove it and the system collapses.
  It is the lab's canonical "endocrine hub" experiment subject.

Metric Suite:
  Network Control Index (NCI)
    Definition: How often possessions route through him before advantage is created.
    Formula: Percentage of offensive possessions with at least one touch by hub
    player before a shot, foul, or turnover results.

  Hormonal Distribution Score (HDS)
    Definition: Entropy of shot distribution when he is on the floor.
    Formula: Shannon entropy of teammate shot attempt distribution (on vs. off).
    Higher entropy = healthier endocrine regulation = more balanced system.

  Latency Time (LT)
    Definition: Average time from first hub touch to creation of advantage.
    Formula: Mean seconds between first possession touch and open shot / foul / layup.
    Mirrors signal transduction delay in biological signaling cascades.

