ARCHETYPE 05: LeBron James -- Master Regulator / Stem Cell
----------------------------------------------------------
Biological Label: Multipotent Stem Cell / Master Transcription Factor
Basketball Phenotype: Morphs into ball-dominant initiator, off-ball scorer,
  small-ball 5, or point-forward depending on roster, era, and opponent.

Narrative Arc:
  LeBron does not specialize -- he differentiates. Like a stem cell responding to
  environmental signals, he reads the ecosystem and becomes what is needed.
  His plasticity is both his evolutionary advantage and his study subject:
  how does a master regulator maintain system stability across radically different contexts?

Metric Suite:
  Plasticity Index (PI)
    Definition: Diversity of statistical roles per season.
    Formula: Composite of usage rate variance + assist rate + rebound rate
    + positional matchup mix across seasons.

  Regulator Impact Score (RIS)
    Definition: Change in lineup efficiency and Codex metrics when he is on vs. off.
    Formula: Delta of Flow, Gravity, ORtg, DRtg across on/off splits.

  Differentiation Map
    Definition: Clustering of his seasons into cell types.
    Method: K-means or hierarchical clustering of season stat vectors into
    "scoring dominant," "facilitator dominant," and "hybrid" phenotypes.

