ARCHETYPE 06: Draymond Green -- T-Cell / Immune Orchestrator
------------------------------------------------------------
Biological Label: T-Cell Subset / Immune Coordinator
Basketball Phenotype: Reads offenses, calls coverages, triggers defensive rotations
  (cytokine cascades), switches, tags rollers, and initiates offense as secondary playmaker.
  Risk of autoimmune overreaction (technicals, ejections) if over-activated.

Narrative Arc:
  The immune archetype is the least individually impressive but the most systemically
  critical. Without coordination, the organism cannot mount a coherent defense.
  The autoimmune risk metric makes this archetype uniquely double-edged.

Metric Suite:
  Immune Coordination Rating (ICR)
    Definition: Team defensive rating, rotation quality, and forced turnover rate
    when on vs. off floor.
    Formula: Weighted delta of DRtg + rotation accuracy score + TOV forced per 100.

  Cytokine Burst Index (CBI)
    Definition: Frequency and impact of high-energy defensive sequences per 100 possessions.
    Formula: Count of wall sets, blitz triggers, and rotation chains initiated
    per 100 possessions, weighted by outcome (stop / foul / score).

  Autoimmune Risk Factor (ARF)
    Definition: Cost of immune over-activation.
    Formula: (Technicals + flagrant fouls + ejections) per 500 minutes.

