ARCHETYPE 07: Dennis Rodman -- Macrophage / Resource Recycler
-------------------------------------------------------------
Biological Label: Macrophage / Phagocyte
Basketball Phenotype: Elite rebounding, chaos generation, minimal on-ball usage.
  Eats debris (missed shots) and recycles resources (extra possessions) for the organism.

Narrative Arc:
  The macrophage archetype does not score. It extends the life of the organism by
  converting failure (missed shots, loose balls) into second chances.
  Its value is invisible to traditional metrics -- which makes it a perfect BBTech
  case study for non-traditional value quantification.

Metric Suite:
  Phagocytosis Rate (PR)
    Definition: Missed shot and loose-ball recovery efficiency.
    Formula: (Offensive rebounds + defensive rebounds + loose-ball recoveries)
    / total rebound and recovery chances.

  Resource Recycling Score (RRS)
    Definition: Points per 100 possessions directly following his rebounds and recoveries.
    Formula: Team points scored on possessions immediately following his
    rebound / recovery events per 100.

  Inflammation Index (II)
    Definition: Net effect on game chaos.
    Formula: (Fouls drawn + scrums + dead-ball situations + tempo swings induced)
    per 100 possessions, net of opponent disruption caused.

