ARCHETYPE 08: Giannis Antetokounmpo -- Invasive Species / Metastatic Sprinter
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Biological Label: Invasive Species / Rapidly Spreading Metastasis
Basketball Phenotype: North-south attacker, transition terror, rim pressure monster
  who exploits any weakness in environmental barriers via long-stride drives.

Narrative Arc:
  The invasive species archetype does not adapt to the environment -- it overwhelms it.
  Long drives mimic metastatic leaps from primary site to distant organs.
  Defenses must wall inward (five in the paint), creating secondary vulnerabilities
  at the perimeter -- mirroring how tumors force immune resources to one site
  while spreading elsewhere.

Metric Suite:
  Barrier Breach Rate (BBR)
    Definition: Drives penetrating past the first and second line of defense.
    Formula: Percentage of drives reaching restricted area or mid-paint
    past initial and help defenders per 100 possessions.

  Metastatic Reach Score (MRS)
    Definition: Distribution and efficiency of attacks from different zones.
    Formula: Weighted shot efficiency across all court zones from backcourt
    to rim, mapped to organ-site spread model.

  Structural Deformation Index (SDI)
    Definition: How much his presence alone collapses opposing defensive schemes.
    Formula: Extra help defenders in paint + wall formations triggered
    + five-in-paint frequency when he is on floor vs. league baseline.

