ARCHETYPE 09: James Harden / Luka Doncic -- Rule-Exploiting Pathogen
---------------------------------------------------------------------
Biological Label: Rule-Exploiting Pathogen / Loophole Organism
Basketball Phenotype: High pick-and-roll volume, foul drawing, step-backs,
  and pace manipulation. Thrives by extracting free energy from the rulebook
  rather than pure athletic overwhelm.

Narrative Arc:
  Some pathogens do not overpower the immune system -- they find gaps in its logic.
  This archetype models organisms that evolve to exploit the rules of the host system
  rather than outmatch it. Particularly relevant to treatment resistance modeling:
  resistance via loophole discovery vs. resistance via brute force mutation.

Metric Suite:
  Exploit Efficiency Ratio (EER)
    Definition: Points generated via fouls, step-backs, and baited contact
    vs. standard shot profiles.
    Formula: (FTA-derived points + step-back 3PA value) /
    (total points expected from standard shot distribution).

  Rulebook Sensitivity Index (RSI)
    Definition: Drop in efficiency when whistle tightness or rule interpretations change.
    Formula: Efficiency delta between regular season and playoff (or FIBA)
    conditions, normalized by minutes.

  Entropy Manipulation Score (EMS)
    Definition: How effectively he slows tempo and forces the game into preferred phase.
    Formula: Average possession length delta (his possessions vs. opponent possessions)
    + frequency of forced dead-ball situations per 100 possessions.

