Archetype Interaction Model
---------------------------
Archetypes do not operate in isolation. BBTech simulations model their interactions:

  Virus (Curry) + Mutation (Kyrie) + Cancer System (Jordan)
    = Offensive pandemic model: viral spread of style + adaptive mutation under pressure
      + eventual total system takeover.

  Immune Orchestrator (Draymond) + Macrophage (Rodman) + T-Cell variants
    = Full defensive immune system simulation: coordination + debris recycling
      + cytokine cascade timing.

  CNS Hub (Jokic) + Master Regulator (LeBron)
    = Endocrine-CNS co-regulation experiment: what happens when two control-tower
      archetypes share a system? Redundancy vs. competition.

  Invasive Species (Giannis) vs. Immune System (Draymond + Rodman)
    = Immune exclusion experiment: can coordinated defense wall off a
      high-penetration attacker? Maps to tumor microenvironment isolation studies.

  Rule-Exploiting Pathogen (Harden/Luka) vs. any defense
    = Loophole resistance experiment: how do adaptive defenses (rule changes,
      coverage schemes) close gaps vs. a system that exploits logic rather than athleticism?

