Codex Integration
-----------------
All archetype metrics feed into the existing BBTech Codex system:
  TER (Tumor Efficiency Rating)   -- Primary malignancy scoring
  Trueness                        -- Signal accuracy of metric output
  Flow                            -- System tempo and possession quality
  Gravity                         -- Spatial disruption and attention capture
  Four Factors (mapped)           -- Proliferation, clearance, resource capture, metastasis
  DRtg / ORtg                     -- Defensive and offensive system health
  Pace                            -- Cell-cycle / possession timing
  Clutch Performance              -- High-pressure environment response

Each new archetype metric (IR, R0, VL, MCI, DER, CEC, NCI, ICR, etc.) is designed
to slot into the Codex schema and be computable from available basketball data
or analogous biological datasets.

